# The review history and anything a run writes. The history names every vendor
# the organisation assessed and every gap each one had -- a shortlist of which
# of your suppliers to attack, and through what. It does not belong in version
# control.
.vendorreview/
vendorreview.db
review.md
review.html
review.json

# Vendor evidence. A SOC 2 report is usually under NDA and a pen test summary
# always is. Extract them to text next to the intake if that is convenient, but
# do not commit them.
*.soc2.txt
*.pentest.txt
evidence/
